    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρι-φλεγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flaming with fire,
			blazing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.948c
			</span></i>; 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.3.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>violently inflamed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑστέραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.54
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δίψαι</span>
			<i>burning</i> thirst, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
